Libraries loaded from the system at runtime (not distributed)
-------------------------------------------------------------

These are supplied by the user's operating system and are not part of a
JTypeWriter release:

    GLib / GObject / GModule / GThread
    ALSA
    GTK 3, Pango, FreeType
    X11 and OpenGL

FFmpeg is not distributed with JTypeWriter. The libavplugin-*.so files in
the JavaFX media module are Oracle-authored GStreamer adapters that load
libavcodec, libavformat and libswscale from the host at runtime; they do not
contain FFmpeg. The FFmpeg build that ends up in use is therefore the one on
the user's system, and its license is a matter between the user and their
distribution - this project neither grants nor warrants anything for it.


