GStreamer source offer
----------------------

libgstreamer-lite.so ships unmodified. Under LGPL-2.1 section 6 the
corresponding source is available from the same place as the binaries:

    https://github.com/openjdk/jfx26u/tree/26.0.1-ga/modules/javafx.media/
        src/main/native/gstreamer/gstreamer-lite

In addition, JTypeWriter offers - valid for three years from the date this
version of JTypeWriter is released - to provide the complete corresponding
source for the LGPL-2.1 components to anyone who asks. Ask via the GitHub
Release page for this version of JTypeWriter. You may also rebuild
libgstreamer-lite.so yourself and replace the bundled copy with a modified,
interface-compatible build; nothing in JTypeWriter prevents that.


